WEBVTT

00:07:29.116 --> 00:07:30.315
We have knowledge.

00:07:30.339 --> 00:07:31.577
But think about this ...

00:07:31.601 --> 00:07:34.783
This is Houston, Texas,
after Hurricane Harvey.

00:07:35.736 --> 00:07:38.699
Now, I write a contribution
for "Forbes" magazine periodically,

00:07:38.733 --> 00:07:43.264
and I wrote an article a week before
Hurricane Harvey made landfall, saying,

00:07:43.288 --> 00:07:46.130
"There's probably going to be
40 to 50 inches of rainfall."

00:07:46.776 --> 00:07:49.260
I wrote that a week before it happened.

00:07:49.284 --> 00:07:51.410
But yet, when you talk
to people in Houston,

00:07:51.434 --> 00:07:54.507
people are saying, "We had no idea
it was going to be this bad."

00:07:55.093 --> 00:07:56.268
I'm just...

00:07:56.292 --> 00:07:57.473
(Sigh)

00:07:57.497 --> 00:07:58.633
(Laughter)

00:07:58.657 --> 00:07:59.831
A week before.

00:07:59.855 --> 00:08:01.045
But --